  "description": "The Holocaust was the systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. It is the central historical event associated with the Nazi regime and the swastika. The image’s use of burning swastikas invokes this genocide, making the background knowledge of the Holocaust essential to understanding the meme’s hateful intent.",
